        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Michael Noonan, Leo Varadkar\n- Roles: Minister for Finance, Tánaiste, Minister for Social Protection\n- Events: Irish Budget, 2012\n\nFacts:\n- Michael Noonan was the minister responsible for the Irish Budget, 2012, as Minister for Finance.\n- Leo Varadkar held the role of Minister for Social Protection from 2016 until 2017.\n- Leo Varadkar currently holds the role that Michael Noonan held from 2001 to 2002.\n- Michael Noonan held the role of Tánaiste from 2001 to 2002.",
